### Direct calls to vehicule-service (port 8081). Later: replace with http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. List all
GET http://localhost:8081/vehicules

### 2. Filters
GET http://localhost:8081/vehicules?carburant=DIESEL&prixMax=200

### 3. Detail (200) / unknown (404)
GET http://localhost:8081/vehicules/1
###
GET http://localhost:8081/vehicules/999

### 4. Create (201)
POST http://localhost:8081/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "230 TU 1111",
  "marque": "Kia",
  "modele": "Picanto",
  "annee": 2025,
  "couleur": "Vert",
  "carburant": "ESSENCE",
  "boite": "MANUELLE",
  "nbPlaces": 4,
  "kilometrage": 1000,
  "prixJournalier": 70,
  "categorie": "ECONOMIQUE"
}

### 5. Duplicate immatriculation (409)
POST http://localhost:8081/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "123 TU 4567",
  "marque": "Kia", "modele": "Rio", "annee": 2024,
  "carburant": "ESSENCE", "boite": "MANUELLE", "nbPlaces": 5,
  "kilometrage": 0, "prixJournalier": 80, "categorie": "ECONOMIQUE"
}

### 6. Invalid data (400): negative price, future year
POST http://localhost:8081/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "999 TU 9999",
  "marque": "", "modele": "X", "annee": 2030,
  "carburant": "ESSENCE", "boite": "MANUELLE", "nbPlaces": 5,
  "kilometrage": 0, "prixJournalier": -5, "categorie": "ECONOMIQUE"
}

### 7. Change statut
PATCH http://localhost:8081/vehicules/1/statut
Content-Type: application/json

{ "statut": "LOUE" }

### 8. Delete a rented vehicle (409)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/vehicules/1

### 9. Available vehicles for a period
GET http://localhost:8081/vehicules/disponibles?dateDebut=2026-12-01&dateFin=2026-12-05

### 10. Actuator
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
